      "upstreamResult": "A selector returning a fresh reference on every read enters React useSyncExternalStore's warning/update loop.",
      "octaneResult": "Octane settles the unstable selection after a bounded number of renders.",
      "rationale": "Octane's external-store scheduling prevents an unbounded render loop while preserving the latest value.",
      "classification": "framework-integration",
      "consumerImpact": "Misconfigured selectors do not loop indefinitely, but may still cause avoidable rerenders.",
      "migrationGuidance": "Return stable selector values or wrap object/array selectors with useShallow.",
